<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">Power to appoint an attorney or authorised signatory
of the Company</P>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

