    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(a)</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">that the seal or a duplicate seal need not be affixed manually but may be affixed by some other method or system of reproduction;</FONT></TD></TR>
