    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">to vest the whole or any part of the assets in trustees for the benefit of the Members and those liable to contribute to the winding up.</FONT></TD></TR>
